# apps-menu-1: the real main screen with the app menu the APP key opens, on its
# first page. The path is the firmware's own: the APP key loads buttons_group_app
# (src/main_screen.c, KEYPAD_APP) and the page button cycles its six pages
# (src/buttons.cpp, button_next_page_cb). Same radio state as home-usb-20m, so the
# only difference is the button bar.
#
# UI-002: the six fixtures apps-menu-1..6 render the six APP pages, so all 22 app
# cells (post-About, issue #46) are captured and inspected. scenario_settle
# codifies, from the real buttons_group_app table, that the page's button labels
# are the ones on screen (a reordered page stops the run instead of capturing a
# different page green).

name apps-menu-1
screen apps-menu
apps_page 1

seed 20

frequency_hz 14074000
tx_frequency_hz 14074000
fft_width_hz 384000

mode usb
vfo A
agc auto

split false
att false
pre false
atu false
ant 1

smeter_db -73

battery_v 12.1
external_v 13.8
battery_cap 76
charging false

rxtx rx
